  "bodyHash": "E7ejXGmoaBE=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Falling Leaves Plus</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 增强了Minecraft的落叶粒子效果，为每种树木提供独特的视觉表现，让森林显得更加生动且富有个性。不再是所有树木掉落相同的简单粒子，每种树叶都能产生自己独特的落叶、树枝、橡果、松果以及其他自然碎屑。🍃</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">该模组为每一个森林生物群系赋予个性。橡树会掉落橡果，云杉树可能掉落松果，多种树叶类型还包含多种粒子变体，呈现更丰富、更自然的外观。积雪覆盖的树叶会飘落雪花，为冬季景观增添更多氛围。❄️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了内置效果外，本模组完全基于资源包驱动。可以为模组中的树木和资源包添加自定义的粒子纹理和行为，使系统轻松扩展至原版Minecraft之外。🎨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍃 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">环境落叶：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扩展Minecraft的环境落叶效果，提供更丰富的视觉效果和更多样性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">树木专属粒子：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不同树木类型可产生独特的落叶、树枝、橡果、松果及其他碎屑。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子变体：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">单个树叶类型可使用多种粒子纹理，呈现更自然、更少重复的外观。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雪花支持：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">积雪覆盖的树叶可生成雪花而非树叶，营造更具氛围的冬季体验。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌧️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">天气响应效果：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雨天和雷暴可增加粒子活动及风力强度，让风暴更显生动。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自定义风向与运动：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">树叶可旋转、飘散、以不同速度落下，并响应可配置的风向。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然碰撞：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子可与视觉方块形状碰撞，使树叶在细节丰富的方块上更真实地沉积。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灵活自定义：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">调整粒子密度、大小、寿命、风力、重力、碰撞、受影响的方块等参数。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">资源包驱动：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子纹理和行为还可通过资源包进行自定义。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端需要安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric和NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（Fabric上需要安装</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有配置文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有模组都存在所有类型，甚至可能没有任何配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">全局粒子行为通过模组配置文件进行配置，而单个原版和模组树叶类型则可通过资源包进行自定义。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">详细文档、配置示例以及所有可用选项的完整参考可以在GitHub上的</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">中找到。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特别感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pringlebeaver\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PringleBeaver</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">创作了构成此模组外观的精美落叶粒子纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-bone-meal\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-enchants\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
